<title>USA: UtiliCorp gas rate hike approved.</title>
<headline>UtiliCorp gas rate hike approved.</headline>
<dateline>KANSAS CITY, Mo. 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>UtiliCorp United Inc said Monday it received approval from the Kansas Corporation Commission for a $3.35 million, or 4.7 percent, increase in annual revenue from its gas customers in Kansas.</p>
<p>UtiliCorp said it had requested a $5.1 million increase in December 1995. The new rates will be effective December 1 for about 92,000 gas customers in Kansas served by its Peoples Natural Gas and Kansas Public Service divisions.</p>
</text>
